# Mobile

> Python mobile-dev setup shelf. One of several Mobile* repos.

## Purpose
Give a plain-language door to fitzyracing1/Mobile.

## How it works (plain English)
1. Keep the original repo as the place for mobile setup files.
2. Use this clone to explain the idea.
3. Send the reader back to the source.

## Key ideas
- Mobile (the named shelf)
- Python source
- Family of Mobile* repos

## The actual code
```
# source: fitzyracing1/Mobile
open_source()
```

## Line-by-line translation
1. open_source() → “go to fitzyracing1/Mobile”

## Decisions the program makes
- If a reader wants another Mobile snapshot → Mobile-, Mobile_02, mobile_0

## What a person would notice
A named wrap on a mobile-setup door.

## Current status
Barrage clone.

## Next possible steps
Open the source.
